title: $:/changenotes/5.5.0/#9922

* Given the source text, the [[WikiText Serialize Plugin]] reproduces the original formatting byte for byte; without it every rule rebuilds its syntax from the parse tree
* Added `$tw.utils.wikitextParseTree`, a node factory and classification helpers, so an editor that writes or reads WikiText never spells a rule name or tag itself
* A link around formatted text now serializes as `<$link>` or `<a>` instead of `[[undefined|...]]`
